{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">BUFFER-TENANT-NAME function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308986","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">BUFFER-TENANT-NAME function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the name (as a character string) of\nthe tenant that owns the current record in a specified buffer.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function__syntax_GC155L2680477\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d391656e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function__idGDE1Y82662387\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>BUFFER-TENANT-NAME ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var> )</code></pre>\n               \n                \n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An identifier that specifies the name of a record buffer. <p class=\"p\">If\nthe buffer is not populated with a record, this function returns\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>). If the buffer is for a shared table\nor a temp-table, the function returns the empty string (<code class=\"ph codeph\">&quot;&quot;</code>).</p><p class=\"p\">If\nthe buffer contains a record that belongs to a tenant group and\nthe user is a super tenant, the function returns the tenant name\nof one of the members of the group. The tenant name returned is\nindeterminate, but is always the name of a tenant in the group.</p><p class=\"p\">For\na regular tenant user, the record in the buffer always belongs to that\ntenant. So, the function always returns the user&#39;s own tenant name. This\nis true even if the record belongs to a tenant group.</p></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function__notes_GC155M2680487\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d391656e152\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">BUFFER-TENANT-NAME\ncan be used in a WHERE or TENANT-WHERE option as long as the buffer\nspecified by <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var> is not the same as the\nbuffer of the query or FOR EACH statement.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function__see-also_GC155N2680493\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d391656e164\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-TENANT-ID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-TENANT-ID-function.html\">BUFFER-TENANT-ID function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-attribute.html\">BUFFER-TENANT-NAME attribute</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-TENANT-ID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-TENANT-ID-function.html\">BUFFER-TENANT-ID function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CALL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CALL-statement.html\">CALL statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308986","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function.html","type":"Manual"}